            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bouncebin 1.0.8</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Export database now works.</b> It was a link the window did not know
      how to follow, so clicking it did nothing at all. You now get a save
      panel, and the file is revealed in Finder afterwards.</li>
  <li><b>Import database now works reliably.</b> The file chooser was being
      opened in a way a web view can quietly ignore.</li>
  <li>Both say what they are doing: reading, checking, saving, done, or what
      went wrong. Neither is silent any more.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
